* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_mkt (reference/crafted.toml, 17 Nov 2026): market-based trade
* (eqire.mod L23-38, eqirebnd.mod L46-51; M1.3 change 51, docs/m13-plan.md), added to TIMES_Demo
* demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0).
* A third internal region, REG3, with demo12's timeslices and discount rate, is a gas hub: the
* exchange process TU_GAS_HUB carries GAS from REG1 to REG3 and from REG3 to REG2. A region that
* receives through a process what it passes on through the same process to another region is a
* marketplace (ppmain.mod L868: RPC_MARKET(REG3,TU_GAS_HUB,GAS,'EXP')); with its own imports it is
* also RPC_MARKET 'IMP' (L909), and its EQ_IRE rows add the imports of REG2 (eqire.mod L23-29).
* A second process, TU_GAS_FAN, carries GAS from REG2 to both REG1 and REG3. An exporter to several
* regions is a marketplace too (L866); REG2 imports nothing through TU_GAS_FAN, so its rows are the
* export-side rows of EQ_IRE (RPC_EQIRE 'EXP', L905-907; eqire.mod L32-38).
* IRE_BND bounds the exports of both marketplaces, which EQ(l)_IREBND sums as the imports of the
* partner region (eqirebnd.mod L46-51), and REG2's imports through TU_GAS_HUB.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET ALL_REG
/
REG3
/

SET REG
/
 REG3 'REG3'
/

SET TS_GROUP
/
REG3.ANNUAL.ANNUAL
REG3.DAYNITE.SD
REG3.DAYNITE.SN
REG3.DAYNITE.WD
REG3.DAYNITE.WN
REG3.SEASON.S
REG3.SEASON.W
/

SET TS_MAP
/
REG3.S.SD
REG3.S.SN
REG3.W.WD
REG3.W.WN
/

SET COM_TMAP
/
REG3.NRG.GAS
/

SET COM_UNIT
/
REG3.GAS.PJ
/

SET PRC
/
TU_GAS_HUB
TU_GAS_FAN
/

SET PRC_MAP
/
REG1.IRE.TU_GAS_HUB
REG2.IRE.TU_GAS_HUB
REG3.IRE.TU_GAS_HUB
REG1.IRE.TU_GAS_FAN
REG2.IRE.TU_GAS_FAN
REG3.IRE.TU_GAS_FAN
/

SET PRC_ACTUNT
/
REG1.TU_GAS_HUB.NRG.PJ
REG2.TU_GAS_HUB.NRG.PJ
REG3.TU_GAS_HUB.NRG.PJ
REG1.TU_GAS_FAN.NRG.PJ
REG2.TU_GAS_FAN.NRG.PJ
REG3.TU_GAS_FAN.NRG.PJ
/

SET TOP_IRE
/
REG1.GAS.REG3.GAS.TU_GAS_HUB
REG3.GAS.REG2.GAS.TU_GAS_HUB
REG2.GAS.REG1.GAS.TU_GAS_FAN
REG2.GAS.REG3.GAS.TU_GAS_FAN
/

SET PRC_DESC
/
 REG1.TU_GAS_HUB 'Crafted: gas export to the REG3 hub (TIMES.jl demo12_mkt)'
 REG2.TU_GAS_HUB 'Crafted: gas import from the REG3 hub (TIMES.jl demo12_mkt)'
 REG3.TU_GAS_HUB 'Crafted: gas hub between REG1 and REG2 (TIMES.jl demo12_mkt)'
 REG1.TU_GAS_FAN 'Crafted: gas import from REG2 (TIMES.jl demo12_mkt)'
 REG2.TU_GAS_FAN 'Crafted: gas export to REG1 and REG3 (TIMES.jl demo12_mkt)'
 REG3.TU_GAS_FAN 'Crafted: gas import from REG2 (TIMES.jl demo12_mkt)'
/

PARAMETER
ACT_COST ' '/
REG1.2005.TU_GAS_HUB.MEURO05 0.2
REG3.2005.TU_GAS_HUB.MEURO05 0.1
REG2.2005.TU_GAS_FAN.MEURO05 0.3
/

PARAMETER
IRE_BND ' '/
REG3.2010.GAS.ANNUAL.REG2.EXP.UP 40
REG2.2010.GAS.ANNUAL.REG3.EXP.UP 30
REG2.2010.GAS.ANNUAL.REG3.IMP.LO 1
/

PARAMETER
G_DRATE ' '/
REG3.2005.MEuro05 0.05
/

PARAMETER
G_YRFR ' '/
REG3.SD 0.249714611872146
REG3.SN 0.229737442922374
REG3.WD 0.249429223744292
REG3.WN 0.271118721461187
/
